  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></math> are three sides and <math><mi>θ</mi></math> is the smallest angle. Hence three angles are <math><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></math>  <br/>Given, <math><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mrow></math> (using sine rule) <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></math>  <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi></math>  <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ( <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is rejected since <math><mi>θ</mi></math> is acute) <br/><math><mo>∴</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
